    "type": "mc",
    "prompt": "A group of girls stands in a circle. Xena is the fourth on the left from Yana and the seventh on the right from Yana. How many girls are in the group?",
    "image": null,
    "choices": [
      {
        "key": "A",
        "text": "9"
      },
      {
        "key": "B",
        "text": "10"
      },
      {
        "key": "C",
        "text": "11"
      },
      {
        "key": "D",
        "text": "12"
      },
      {
        "key": "E",
        "text": "13"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "C",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Go round the circle",
        "body": "Going left from Yana, Xena is 4 places away; going right, she is 7 places away. Walking 4 places one way and then 7 more places (from Xena back to Yana the other way round) takes us once round the circle: $4 + 7 = 11$ girls.\n\n**Answer: (C) 11**"
      },
      {
        "title": "Count the girls in between",
        "body": "On one side there are 3 girls between Yana and Xena, on the other side 6. Together with Yana and Xena: $3 + 6 + 2 = 11$.\n\n**Answer: (C) 11**"
      }
    ],
    "topics": [
